  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `agent` (Spawn and manage autonomous background agents with persistent state across sessions)\n- **Agents** (1): `worker` (Autonomous background worker for agent-manager)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SubagentStop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-manager@claude-community` from `devhimanshulohani/claude-agent-manager`.",
